DESCRIPTION:Making friends as an adult can be hard\, so Chandler Center fo
 r the Arts and the Upper Valley Welcome Wagon are teaming up for another A
 nalog Social Club Mixer on October 30th from 5:30 - 7 PM at Chandler Cente
 r for the Arts. Here's how it works: you'll chat one-on-one with a handful
  of fellow community members for a few minutes at a time. We'll have easy 
 conversation starters to keep things flowing. If you click with someone\, 
 you can share your contact information. If not\, the next conversation is 
 only a few minutes away. Spots at the mixer are limited\, so please RSVP t
 o reserve your place. And if you'd like to stay for the concert\, grab you
 r tickets here: https://www.chandler-arts.org/ Bring a friend who is new t
 o the area! Costumes encouraged!\n\nSources: Vermont Public
