BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Find Your Song: A Songwriting Workshop with Myra Flynn
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261030
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261031
DTSTAMP:20261030T170326Z
UID:7742eb857971f183c948ae32ce6b86@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Find your song with Vermont singer-songwriter Myra Flynn\, who
  brings more than 15 years of experience helping aspiring musicians turn i
 deas into songs. A longtime songwriter and recording artist\, Myra has tau
 ght songwriting in New York City and Los Angeles and brings a working musi
 cian’s perspective to the craft. In this four-day workshop\, participant
 s will explore practical tools for developing an idea\, shaping a song\, a
 nd turning life experiences into stories told through music. Early session
 s focus on songwriting fundamentals and developing each participant’s or
 iginal song. Later sessions offer opportunities to share works in progress
 \, receive group feedback\, and refine songs while preserving their origin
 al spark. Myra will also discuss marketing\, booking\, recording\, and bui
 lding a sustainable creative life. The workshop concludes with a songwriti
 ng culmination for friends and family. No previous songwriting experience 
 is required\, and participants do not need to read music or play an instru
 ment. Those who play an instrument are encouraged to bring it.\n\nSources:
  Vermont.com\, Vermont Public
LOCATION:Chandler Center for the Arts\, 71 N. Main Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/find-your-
 song-a-songwriting-workshop-with-myra-flynn-29-09-2026-18-57-11
END:VEVENT
