BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Lakou Mizik Haitian Halloween Dance Party
DTSTART:20261030T190000
DTEND:20261030T210000
DTSTAMP:20261030T170326Z
UID:deed64a53405e5c0139c599f9bc4df@vermont-events
DESCRIPTION:Bring your costume and your dancing shoes! Celebrate Halloween
  weekend at Chandler with Lakou Mizik\, a powerhouse collective of Haitian
  roots musicians whose soulful energy and vibrant mix of styles invite aud
 iences to move\, connect\, and celebrate. Formed in the wake of Haiti’s 
 devastating earthquake\, Lakou Mizik came together to show the world a ful
 ler picture of their country beyond the headlines. Their music celebrates 
 Haiti’s creativity\, resilience\, and cultural richness\, bringing a spi
 rit of joy and connection to the stage. With a sound that feels both mysti
 cal and familiar\, the group offers an uplifting introduction to Haitian r
 oots music. Gather your friends and join us for a Halloween dance party fi
 lled with soulful vocals\, infectious rhythms\, and live music. Costumes a
 re encouraged\, so come ready to celebrate!\n\nSources: Vermont Public
LOCATION:Chandler Center for the Arts\, 71 N. Main Street
URL:https://www.vermontpublic.org/vermont-events-calendar/event/lakou-mizi
 k-haitian-halloween-dance-party-07-10-2026-22-06-59
END:VEVENT
